    // Optimized schedule for the Jacobi stencil
    //
    //  - We only ever realize over the interior (x,y in [1..n-2]), so we
    //    bound x and y accordingly; this lets Halide reason about loop
    //    extents more effectively.
    //  - We tile the iteration space to improve cache locality.
    //  - We vectorize along x (the innermost / contiguous dimension).
    //  - We parallelize across tiles in y, exploiting all CPU cores.
